802
00:45:04,751 --> 00:45:05,751
Yeah.

803
00:45:06,501 --> 00:45:07,751
I'm breathing the air!

804
00:45:09,001 --> 00:45:10,168
I'm breathing the air!

805
00:45:10,835 --> 00:45:11,918
I'm breathing the air!

806
