Stay back.

879
00:48:56,918 --> 00:48:58,001
Get back.
Get back.

880
00:49:01,001 --> 00:49:02,042
- Dad.
- Dad.

881
00:49:02,043 --> 00:49:03,334
Sully, we good?

882
00:49:03,335 --> 00:49:05,334
You ready?
All right, kids. On me.

883
00:49:05,335 --> 00:49:06,834
All right.

884
00:49:06,835 --> 00:49:08,625
We're gonna ease on
outta here.

885
00:49:08,626 --> 00:49:09,750
