886
00:49:09,751 --> 00:49:11,626
- On me. On me.
- [Lo'ak] Keep back.

887
00:49:12,501 --> 00:49:13,376
Keep moving.

888
00:49:17,085 --> 00:49:19,167
- [shouting]
- [gasps]

889
00:49:19,168 --> 00:49:21,501
- [snarls]
- [groaning]

890
00:49:23,835 --> 00:49:25,917
[shouts]

891
00:49:25,918 --> 00:49:26,959
No!

892
00:49:26,960 --> 00:49:27,793
Dad!

893
00:49:30,251 --> 00:49:31,168
[Tuk] Dad!

894
00:49:33,918 --> 00:49:35,000
