895
00:49:35,001 --> 00:49:36,001
Move.

896
00:49:37,251 --> 00:49:39,376
- [Wainfleet grunting]
- [raiders ululating]

897
00:49:45,585 --> 00:49:46,792
- No!
- [Tuk] Dad!

898
00:49:46,793 --> 00:49:48,875
- Dad.
- Dad! Dad!

899
