[raiders laughing]

902
00:50:02,251 --> 00:50:03,668
[snarls]

903
00:50:04,960 --> 00:50:06,668
You are strong,

904
00:50:07,376 --> 00:50:09,043
Sky Man.

905
00:50:09,751 --> 00:50:10,751
