912
00:50:37,793 --> 00:50:39,460
Well, just go like this.

913
00:50:42,501 --> 00:50:43,584
[raiders gasp]

914
00:50:43,585 --> 00:50:44,668
Yeah.

915
00:50:47,376 --> 00:50:48,460
Go on.

916
00:50:49,168 --> 00:50:50,168
[grunts]

917
