Get up. Come on.
We got to move. Let's go.

1040
00:58:32,418 --> 00:58:34,375
- Come on. Come on.
- Come on.

1041
00:58:34,376 --> 00:58:35,543
Come on. We got to move.

1042
00:58:36,626 --> 00:58:38,418
[ululating]

1043
00:58:38,960 --> 00:58:40,084
It's okay. It's okay.

1044
00:58:40,085 --> 00:58:41,584
They're ours.
They're ours.

1045
00:58:41,585 --> 00:58:42,625
[whooping]

1046
00:58:42,626 --> 00:58:43,626
Tarsem! [whoops]

1047
00:58:47,876 --> 00:58:50,209
- Jake.
- [Kiri] Tarsem.

1048
00:58:50,210 --> 00:58:53,167
Kiri, Tuk, are you hurt?

1049
00:58:53,168 --> 00:58:54,376
