1050
00:58:55,876 --> 00:58:57,460
[Neytiri] Children!

1051
00:58:59,543 --> 00:59:00,834
- [Lo'ak] Mother.
- [Tuk] Mama.

1052
00:59:00,835 --> 00:59:02,793
Tuk. Tuk. Kiri.

1053
00:59:03,418 --> 00:59:04,626
Lo'ak.

1054
00:59:06,793 --> 00:59:08,376
- [Jake] Hey.
- Jake.

1055
00:59:09,210 --> 00:59:10,500
Are you okay? [sobs]

1056
00:59:10,501 --> 00:59:11,792
Come here. It's okay.

1057
00:59:11,793 --> 00:59:12,751
We're okay.

1058
00:59:14,876 --> 00:59:16,250
[Spider] Hey, Norm.

1059
00:59:16,251 --> 00:59:17,585
[♪ hopeful music plays]

1060
00:59:18,501 --> 00:59:19,501
What's up?

1061
00:59:22,751 --> 00:59:23,751
What?

1062
00:59:25,376 --> 00:59:26,459
What...

1063
00:59:26,460 --> 00:59:27,543
Dude.

1064
00:59:28,585 --> 00:59:29,500
Oh.

1065
00:59:29,501 --> 00:59:31,543
Yeah, I'm good
on the whole air thing.

1066
00:59:32,043 --> 00:59:34,335
[♪ majestic music plays]

1067
00:59:38,668 --> 00:59:39,751
[shrieks]

1068
00:59:40,418 --> 00:59:42,335
