Come here.

2393
02:12:46,043 --> 02:12:47,043
What's
going on?

2394
02:12:50,335 --> 02:12:51,376
What is it?

2395
02:12:52,251 --> 02:12:53,543
Just come with me.

2396
02:12:56,043 --> 02:12:57,126
Come on. Let's go.

2397
02:12:59,960 --> 02:13:01,668
[breathing heavily]

2398
02:13:06,918 --> 02:13:08,709
Hey, stop for a second.
I gotta take a leak.

2399
02:13:08,710 --> 02:13:10,126
Just stay close.

2400
02:13:19,293 --> 02:13:20,418
Where are we going?

2401
02:13:21,085 --> 02:13:22,168
Be quiet.

2402
02:13:27,876 --> 02:13:29,793
[breathing heavily]

2403
02:13:37,585 --> 02:13:39,543
So, is this,
like, a talk?

2404
02:13:51,126 --> 02:13:52,417
[sighs]

2405
02:13:52,418 --> 02:13:53,417
Come here.

2406
02:13:53,418 --> 02:13:54,751
Come on.
Come on.

2407
02:13:55,918 --> 02:13:56,835
Go.

2408
02:13:58,626 --> 02:13:59,793
This'll work.

2409
02:14:01,043 --> 02:14:02,043
Kneel.

2410
02:14:02,751 --> 02:14:04,042
Kneel.

2411
02:14:04,043 --> 02:14:05,125
- No.
- Kneel down.

2412
02:14:05,126 --> 02:14:06,750
[Spider grunting]

2413
02:14:06,751 --> 02:14:08,542
Please.

2414
02:14:08,543 --> 02:14:10,043
Jake, please stop.

2415
02:14:10,668 --> 02:14:12,835
Eyes front. Don't move.

2416
02:14:13,418 --> 02:14:14,792
Please,

2417
02:14:14,793 --> 02:14:16,167
you don't have
to do this.

2418
02:14:16,168 --> 02:14:18,209
- Shh!
- [breathes heavily]

2419
02:14:18,210 --> 02:14:19,210
Please.

2420
02:14:20,210 --> 02:14:21,835
Great Mother, are you here?

2421
02:14:23,835 --> 02:14:25,210
[Spider] You don't
have to do this.

2422
02:14:26,085 --> 02:14:27,125
Guide my hand.

2423
02:14:27,126 --> 02:14:28,209
[Spider] Please don't do this.

2424
02:14:28,210 --> 02:14:29,584
Give me strength.

2425
02:14:29,585 --> 02:14:31,084
Just stop.

2426
02:14:31,085 --> 02:14:32,918
Please stop. Please.

2427
02:14:33,460 --> 02:14:34,917
- Don't look at me.
- Please.

2428
02:14:34,918 --> 02:14:36,043
Don't look at me.

2429
02:14:37,251 --> 02:14:38,251
[inhales sharply]

2430
02:14:38,960 --> 02:14:40,085
Forgive me, Son.

2431
02:14:40,585 --> 02:14:41,667
I'll be good.

2432
02:14:41,668 --> 02:14:43,334
May your spirit go to Eywa.

2433
02:14:43,335 --> 02:14:44,667
- I promise.
- May your body

2434
02:14:44,668 --> 02:14:46,334
return to the forest...

2435
02:14:46,335 --> 02:14:47,584
[sniffles]

2436
02:14:47,585 --> 02:14:48,667
Please, Dad.

2437
02:14:48,668 --> 02:14:50,293
...to preserve
the Great Balance.

2438
02:14:51,126 --> 02:14:53,292
May the ancestors
welcome you.

2439
02:14:53,293 --> 02:14:55,293
[sobbing]

2440
02:15:05,751 --> 02:15:06,876
[exhales sharply, exclaims]

2441
02:15:08,043 --> 02:15:09,043
Please.

2442
02:15:10,043 --> 02:15:12,459
May the ancestors
hold you.

2443
02:15:12,460 --> 02:15:14,376
May they sing
your Song.

2444
02:15:15,751 --> 02:15:17,585
I know I have to go
to Eywa now.

2445
02:15:19,001 --> 02:15:20,251
It's okay.

2446
02:15:21,210 --> 02:15:22,210
But...

2447
02:15:23,585 --> 02:15:24,585
Do you...

2448
02:15:25,668 --> 02:15:27,085
Do you still love me?

2449
02:15:29,085 --> 02:15:30,626
With all my heart.

2450
02:15:34,876 --> 02:15:36,876
[♪ emotional music playing]

2451
02:15:40,085 --> 02:15:42,085
[both breathing shakily]

2452
02:15:52,251 --> 02:15:53,251
[grunts]

2453
02:15:54,418 --> 02:15:56,168
[Spider panting]

2454
02:15:58,501 --> 02:15:59,835
[breathing shakily]

2455
02:16:14,626 --> 02:16:16,210
[crying] <i>Ma Jake</i>. <i>Ma Jake</i>.

2456
02:16:27,793 --> 02:16:29,251
I See you.

2457
02:16:36,585 --> 02:16:39,417
Whatever happens,
it won't be this way.

2458
02:16:39,418 --> 02:16:41,500
[Neytiri breathing heavily]

2459
02:16:41,501 --> 02:16:43,751
Then we will find
another way.

2460
02:16:48,501 --> 02:16:50,501
[♪ hopeful music playing]

2461
02:17:00,460 --> 02:17:01,668
[Lo'ak] <i>My dad knew
in his heart</i>

2462
02:17:02,168 --> 02:17:03,125
<i>there was only</i>

2463
02:17:03,126 --> 02:17:05,335
<i>ever one path.</i>

2464
02:17:08,876 --> 02:17:10,126
[Jake breathes shakily]

2465
02:17:12,418 --> 02:17:14,293
[Lo'ak] <i>No matter
how you imagine yourself,</i>

2466
02:17:15,210 --> 02:17:16,335
<i>as a father,</i>

2467
02:17:16,876 --> 02:17:18,001
<i>as a husband,</i>

2468
02:17:18,835 --> 02:17:20,001
<i>sooner or later,</i>

2469
02:17:20,668 --> 02:17:21,793
<i>you're back on it.</i>

2470
02:17:22,751 --> 02:17:24,751
- [Toruk breathing heavily]
- [Jake exhales deeply]

2471
02:17:37,668 --> 02:17:39,668
[Toruk rumbling]

2472
02:17:41,418 --> 02:17:43,084
Hello, old friend.

2473
02:17:43,085 --> 02:17:44,585
[sighs]

2474
02:17:45,626 --> 02:17:47,376
[Lo'ak] Toruk <i>loved my father.</i>

2475
02:17:48,751 --> 02:17:50,125
[screeches]

2476
02:17:50,126 --> 02:17:52,210
[Lo'ak] <i>It knew they were
greater together.</i>

2477
02:17:52,793 --> 02:17:53,793
<i>That when they flew,</i>

2478
02:17:54,918 --> 02:17:56,210
<i>there would be blood.</i>

2479
02:17:57,876 --> 02:17:59,792
[Toruk screeches]

2480
02:17:59,793 --> 02:18:00,918
He is coming.

2481
02:18:02,460 --> 02:18:04,460
[♪ dramatic music plays]

2482
02:18:05,460 --> 02:18:07,709
[clan whooping]

2483
02:18:07,710 --> 02:18:09,293
[speaking Na'vi]

2484
02:18:20,460 --> 02:18:23,001
[roars]

2485
02:18:25,585 --> 02:18:27,167
<i>Toruk Makto!</i>

2486
02:18:27,168 --> 02:18:28,168
[clan grunts]

2487
02:18:30,418 --> 02:18:32,042
No, no, no. Just...

2488
02:18:32,043 --> 02:18:33,917
Please, stand.

2489
02:18:33,918 --> 02:18:35,960
Stand up. Please.

2490
02:18:36,626 --> 02:18:37,835
- Baby.
- Jake.

2491
02:18:39,043 --> 02:18:40,709
Please. It's okay.

2492
02:18:40,710 --> 02:18:41,710
It's okay.

2493
02:18:43,793 --> 02:18:45,459
Go now

2494
02:18:45,460 --> 02:18:47,000
to all the clans
within a day's ride

2495
02:18:47,001 --> 02:18:48,043
and tell 'em...

2496
02:18:49,085 --> 02:18:50,210
[sighs]

2497
02:18:51,043 --> 02:18:53,085
Tell 'em <i>Toruk Makto</i>
calls to them.

2498
02:18:55,126 --> 02:18:56,710
And you tell 'em...

2499
02:18:58,376 --> 02:18:59,835
the day has come.

2500
02:19:08,751 --> 02:19:09,875
[shouts]

2501
02:19:09,876 --> 02:19:11,418
[ululating]

2502
02:19:35,418 --> 02:19:36,918
[cheering]

2503
02:19:39,793 --> 02:19:41,376
[Lo'ak] <i>And so it came to pass</i>

2504
02:19:42,085 --> 02:19:43,959
<i>that</i> Toruk Makto
<i>returned.</i>

2505
02:19:43,960 --> 02:19:45,959
<i>My father united
the clans</i>

2506
02:19:45,960 --> 02:19:47,126
<i>once again.</i>

2507
02:19:48,293 --> 02:19:49,918
<i>He made the
great speeches.</i>

2508
02:19:50,460 --> 02:19:51,667
Many arrows together

2509
02:19:51,668 --> 02:19:53,710
cannot be broken.

2510
02:19:56,001 --> 02:19:58,167
We cannot be broken!

2511
02:19:58,168 --> 02:19:59,668
[cheering]

2512
02:20:00,418 --> 02:20:01,918
[♪ inspirational music plays]

2513
02:20:05,876 --> 02:20:08,210
[Lo'ak] <i>But he knew
that it wasn't enough.</i>

2514
02:20:26,293 --> 02:20:28,125
Great Matriarch,

2515
02:20:28,126 --> 02:20:29,460
wise elders,

2516
02:20:31,293 --> 02:20:32,710
the Sky People are coming.

2517
02:20:33,668 --> 02:20:34,959
Here, today.

2518
02:20:34,960 --> 02:20:36,126
Right now.

2519
02:20:37,126 --> 02:20:38,793
To kill our <i>tulkun</i> families.

2520
02:20:39,585 --> 02:20:40,585
I beg you,

2521
02:20:41,710 --> 02:20:42,918
fight with us.

2522
02:20:47,168 --> 02:20:48,668
[rumbles]

2523
02:20:51,376 --> 02:20:54,126
She says,
"We respect <i>Toruk Makto</i>,

2524
02:20:55,085 --> 02:20:56,835
but our ways
are ancient."

2525
02:20:57,585 --> 02:20:59,085
[rumbles]

2526
02:21:01,085 --> 02:21:02,667
"We believe

2527
02:21:02,668 --> 02:21:04,918
that killing will only
bring more killing,

2528
02:21:05,585 --> 02:21:08,251
in an endless,
expanding spiral."

2529
02:21:11,001 --> 02:21:12,210
Hear my words.

2530
02:21:13,835 --> 02:21:16,501
The Sky People
will never stop.

2531
02:21:17,168 --> 02:21:19,585
Not until the last
of the <i>tulkun</i> is hunted.

2532
02:21:20,126 --> 02:21:22,126
[bellows]

2533
02:21:27,043 --> 02:21:27,918
Lo'ak.

2534
02:21:35,710 --> 02:21:36,835
[Payakan]

2535
02:21:38,168 --> 02:21:39,876
[matriarch]

2536
02:21:41,835 --> 02:21:43,000
Stop.

2537
02:21:43,001 --> 02:21:44,584
Lo'ak, what are you doing?
You can't be here.

2538
02:21:44,585 --> 02:21:45,835
Dad, wait.

2539
02:21:47,418 --> 02:21:50,084
I am Brother of <i>tulkun.</i>
I have a right to speak.

2540
02:21:50,085 --> 02:21:53,168
Lo'ak speaks the truth.
You must listen.

2541
02:21:53,710 --> 02:21:54,710
Tsireya.

2542
02:21:55,210 --> 02:21:56,710
[rumbles]

2543
02:21:59,335 --> 02:22:01,918
She says,
"His Brother is outcast."

2544
02:22:02,668 --> 02:22:05,043
You have no standing here.

2545
02:22:07,043 --> 02:22:08,543
If he is outcast,

2546
02:22:09,376 --> 02:22:11,001
then I am outcast.

2547
02:22:12,001 --> 02:22:14,167
And I am outcast.

2548
02:22:14,168 --> 02:22:15,667
Daughter, silence.

2549
02:22:15,668 --> 02:22:16,668
No.

2550
02:22:17,168 --> 02:22:19,001
You will never
see me again.

2551
02:22:21,126 --> 02:22:23,584
And I and my Brother
are outcast.

2552
02:22:23,585 --> 02:22:25,000
Aonung.

2553
02:22:25,001 --> 02:22:27,250
And we are

2554
02:22:27,251 --> 02:22:28,168
also outcast.

2555
02:22:35,168 --> 02:22:37,168
- [Neytiri breathes shakily]
- [rumbles, clicks]

2556
02:22:40,668 --> 02:22:43,210
She says,
"You may speak."

2557
02:22:47,501 --> 02:22:49,000
[Lo'ak] Hear my words.

2558
02:22:49,001 --> 02:22:51,167
My Brother returned
to his birth clan

2559
02:22:51,168 --> 02:22:52,293
to defend them,

2560
02:22:53,001 --> 02:22:55,125
but his clan
was wiped out

2561
02:22:55,126 --> 02:22:56,460
by the demon ships.

2562
02:22:56,960 --> 02:22:58,626
Only Ta'nok survived,

2563
02:22:59,168 --> 02:23:00,710
because she fought back.

2564
02:23:02,126 --> 02:23:03,251
Come forward.

2565
02:23:03,835 --> 02:23:05,293
[♪ mournful music playing]

2566
02:23:20,085 --> 02:23:21,460
[sighs]

2567
02:23:23,460 --> 02:23:24,960
[exhales]

2568
02:23:25,751 --> 02:23:27,251
[Ta'nok wails]

2569
02:23:30,501 --> 02:23:31,792
Ta'nok says,

2570
02:23:31,793 --> 02:23:35,126
"I speak
for the dead mothers

2571
02:23:35,960 --> 02:23:36,960
and the dead calves."

2572
02:23:37,543 --> 02:23:38,960
[Ta'nok moaning]

2573
02:23:42,876 --> 02:23:45,626
"I speak for my people
and all our Songs."

2574
02:23:46,335 --> 02:23:48,209
[wailing]

2575
02:23:48,210 --> 02:23:49,251
"Gone.

2576
02:23:50,835 --> 02:23:52,001
Forever."

2577
02:23:54,043 --> 02:23:56,959
[wailing]

2578
02:23:56,960 --> 02:23:57,875
She says,

2579
02:23:57,876 --> 02:24:00,876
"I am the last.
The blind witness to our end."

2580
02:24:02,793 --> 02:24:05,043
- [Ta'nok wails]
- [sniffles, sighs]

2581
02:24:07,543 --> 02:24:08,625
Ta'nok says,

2582
02:24:08,626 --> 02:24:10,751
"The <i>tulkun</i> way
must change.

2583
02:24:11,293 --> 02:24:13,126
Payakan shows our path."

2584
02:24:13,960 --> 02:24:15,585
[rumbling]

2585
02:24:17,418 --> 02:24:19,418
[bellows]

2586
02:24:20,918 --> 02:24:22,585
"We must fight."

2587
02:24:23,085 --> 02:24:24,418
We must fight!

2588
02:24:26,668 --> 02:24:28,251
[rumbling]

2589
02:24:42,001 --> 02:24:43,335
What did she say?

2590
02:24:44,001 --> 02:24:45,460
They will decide.

2591
02:24:46,876 --> 02:24:47,793
Look at all of this.

2592
02:24:49,043 --> 02:24:51,085
I mean, there's
hundreds of 'em.

2593
02:24:52,126 --> 02:24:53,792
And look at all
these old ones.

2594
02:24:53,793 --> 02:24:54,960
And old is good.

2595
02:24:55,876 --> 02:24:57,293
They never stop growing,

2596
02:24:58,126 --> 02:24:59,585
which means more amrita.

2597
02:25:01,043 --> 02:25:02,459
And look at this mama.

2598
02:25:02,460 --> 02:25:03,375
She must be

2599
02:25:03,376 --> 02:25:04,543
100 meters.

2600
02:25:06,001 --> 02:25:07,001
You're briefing
without me.

2601
02:25:08,376 --> 02:25:10,043
An oversight,
I assume.

2602
02:25:10,543 --> 02:25:12,335
No, it was not
an oversight.

2603
02:25:12,918 --> 02:25:14,209
After your fiasco
with Sully,

2604
02:25:14,210 --> 02:25:15,376
you're done, Colonel.

2605
02:25:16,043 --> 02:25:17,167
You're confined to base

2606
02:25:17,168 --> 02:25:18,293
pending
an investigation.

2607
02:25:19,126 --> 02:25:21,084
Negative on that. I need to roll.

2608
02:25:21,085 --> 02:25:23,250
Sully will be there,
which means that Spider

2609
02:25:23,251 --> 02:25:24,250
will be there as well.

2610
02:25:24,251 --> 02:25:25,167
Don't look at him.

2611
02:25:25,168 --> 02:25:26,501
He's one step away
from the brig himself.

2612
02:25:27,126 --> 02:25:28,584
Don't tell him
not to look at me.

2613
02:25:28,585 --> 02:25:30,709
What are you gonna do?
Call Daddy?

2614
02:25:30,710 --> 02:25:32,543
- You mean the chairman?
- That's enough.

2615
02:25:34,335 --> 02:25:36,834
I can still complete
this mission.

2616
02:25:36,835 --> 02:25:37,918
Look at you.

2617
02:25:38,585 --> 02:25:40,250
You're a disgrace
to your uniform.

2618
02:25:40,251 --> 02:25:42,751
Assuming you remember
what a uniform is.

2619
02:25:44,085 --> 02:25:46,084
You're grounded, Colonel.

2620
02:25:46,085 --> 02:25:47,293
Permanently.

2621
02:25:48,085 --> 02:25:50,334
[sighs]

2622
02:25:50,335 --> 02:25:52,335
[clan speaking Na'vi]

2623
02:26:02,835 --> 02:26:04,793
- [breathing heavily]
- Why are you here, girl?

2624
02:26:07,293 --> 02:26:08,710
To pray, <i>Tsahìk</i>.

2625
02:26:11,751 --> 02:26:12,835
[pants]

2626
02:26:13,501 --> 02:26:14,626
No, child.

2627
02:26:18,543 --> 02:26:20,418
Why did you
come to us?

2628
02:26:23,585 --> 02:26:24,751
Perhaps

2629
02:26:25,251 --> 02:26:26,959
it was for this moment.

2630
02:26:26,960 --> 02:26:28,501
[inhales sharply]

2631
02:26:29,001 --> 02:26:30,084
Only a chosen one

2632
02:26:30,085 --> 02:26:31,251
may call

2633
02:26:32,001 --> 02:26:33,709
upon the Warrior Mother.

2634
02:26:33,710 --> 02:26:35,168
[inhales sharply, groans]

2635
02:26:36,751 --> 02:26:38,000
[groans]

2636
02:26:38,001 --> 02:26:39,376
<i>Tsahìk.</i>

2637
02:26:40,168 --> 02:26:41,668
You're having contractions.

2638
02:26:42,210 --> 02:26:44,000
I fear we will...

2639
02:26:44,001 --> 02:26:45,834
we will not survive this.

2640
02:26:45,835 --> 02:26:48,168
[breathing shakily]

2641
02:26:50,668 --> 02:26:51,668
Kiri.

2642
02:26:54,668 --> 02:26:56,251
Hear my words.

2643
02:26:57,126 --> 02:27:00,126
If there is something
you can do,

2644
02:27:01,876 --> 02:27:03,918
then you must
do it.

2645
02:27:06,835 --> 02:27:09,710
You have
a strong heart.

2646
02:27:10,793 --> 02:27:11,793
Here.

2647
02:27:12,751 --> 02:27:13,835
I'm riding with you?

2648
02:27:14,501 --> 02:27:15,960
No, I need you here.

2649
02:27:16,793 --> 02:27:17,875
[sighs]

2650
02:27:17,876 --> 02:27:18,959
I can't do this

2651
02:27:18,960 --> 02:27:21,459
unless I know
you kids are safe.

2652
02:27:21,460 --> 02:27:23,209
You keep your post
no matter what happens.

2653
02:27:23,210 --> 02:27:24,210
You read me?

2654
02:27:25,001 --> 02:27:26,210
Lima Charlie, sir.

2655
02:27:33,001 --> 02:27:34,626
If your father and I
do not return,

2656
02:27:35,335 --> 02:27:37,625
you take Spider
and the girls

2657
02:27:37,626 --> 02:27:40,543
and you go as far
and as fast as you can.

2658
02:27:43,335 --> 02:27:45,335
[♪ tense music playing]

2659
02:27:53,585 --> 02:27:55,918
[shouting, ululating]

2660
02:27:59,418 --> 02:28:01,418
[♪ music intensifies]

