I "learn to See"?

3213
03:03:36,585 --> 03:03:38,126
You have a choice.

3214
03:03:40,960 --> 03:03:42,668
[ikran shrieks]

3215
03:03:49,251 --> 03:03:51,084
- Wait.
- [snarls]

3216
03:03:51,085 --> 03:03:52,668
- Wait. Wait.
- [Neytiri snarls]

3217
03:03:53,543 --> 03:03:54,668
- [Jake] Wait. Wait.
- [Tuk snarls]

3218
03:03:58,376 --> 03:03:59,585
[snarls]

3219
03:04:00,710 --> 03:04:02,334
Ain't this a bitch?

3220
03:04:02,335 --> 03:04:04,126
[♪ dramatic music plays]

3221
03:04:05,543 --> 03:04:06,543
[snarls]

3222
03:04:17,501 --> 03:04:19,251
[screams]

3223
03:04:28,293 --> 03:04:29,293
- [grunts]
- Dad, Dad.

3224
03:04:29,918 --> 03:04:31,709
<i>Ma Jake,</i> s-sit.

3225
03:04:31,710 --> 03:04:32,709
Come here. [sighs]

3226
03:04:32,710 --> 03:04:33,834
[sighs]

3227
03:04:33,835 --> 03:04:35,501
