3228
03:04:48,918 --> 03:04:50,668
[Lo'ak]
<i>The light always returns.</i>

3229
03:04:51,543 --> 03:04:53,376
[♪ uplifting music plays]

3230
03:04:55,126 --> 03:04:57,835
[tulkun whistling, rumbling]

3231
03:05:02,710 --> 03:05:03,792
[Lo'ak] <i>We all connect</i>

3232
03:05:03,793 --> 03:05:05,126
<i>with the Great Mother...</i>

3233
03:05:07,376 --> 03:05:08,875
<i>who holds all her children</i>

3234
03:05:08,876 --> 03:05:09,876
<i>in her heart.</i>

3235
03:05:15,043 --> 03:05:17,710
<i>New life keeps
the energy flowing...</i>

3236
03:05:20,001 --> 03:05:21,376
<i>like the breath
of the world.</i>

3237
03:05:25,001 --> 03:05:27,000
<i>My Brother's voice was heard.</i>

3238
03:05:27,001 --> 03:05:28,750
[Payakan rumbles]

3239
03:05:28,751 --> 03:05:30,668
[Lo'ak] <i>He was accepted
by the clan.</i>

3240
03:05:44,876 --> 03:05:46,542
<i>In the Spirit World,</i>

3241
03:05:46,543 --> 03:05:49,168
