3261
03:07:02,251 --> 03:07:03,251
Forever.

3262
03:07:04,710 --> 03:07:07,626
You are one of us now.

3263
03:07:08,168 --> 03:07:10,585
You are one of The People.

3264
03:07:11,918 --> 03:07:13,542
No shit. [chuckles]

